[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6301.91, "timestamp": "01:45:01", "text": "还在探索其他领域，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6304.229, "timestamp": "01:45:04", "text": "我想知道我擅长什么？不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6306.55, "timestamp": "01:45:06", "text": "所以我尝试了平面设计和游戏设计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6308.87, "timestamp": "01:45:08", "text": "配音等等。学习统一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6311.43, "timestamp": "01:45:11", "text": "看教程都是些什么呢？所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6313.75, "timestamp": "01:45:13", "text": "因为我想要自己的商品，所以就想这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6316.629, "timestamp": "01:45:16", "text": "还有服装系列，时尚之类的东西。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6318.149, "timestamp": "01:45:18", "text": "当时正在研究时装设计"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6321.669, "timestamp": "01:45:21", "text": "YouTube上的教程。我拆解了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6324.39, "timestamp": "01:45:24", "text": "小衣服，像缝起来的那种"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6327.43, "timestamp": "01:45:27", "text": "一些随机的东西。所以，这还挺有意思的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6329.83, "timestamp": "01:45:29", "text": "这样做。所以，我在想也许我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6332.31, "timestamp": "01:45:32", "text": "在那里可以做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6336.79, "timestamp": "01:45:36", "text": "另外，我很喜欢发型。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6339.109, "timestamp": "01:45:39", "text": "发型设计等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6341.35, "timestamp": "01:45:41", "text": "我喜欢这个。所以我想也许我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6343.75, "timestamp": "01:45:43", "text": "如果一切都行不通，那就去做理发师吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6347.59, "timestamp": "01:45:47", "text": "现在我有很多备用方案。所以"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6351.134, "timestamp": "01:45:51", "author": "@DinyoFoxy", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DGXvUKi0q0ld5Zo5CNG2tmulZfZqg_h6ivQHLtQfKyx-z_EjHr-Bx7limqyg4JtpZ00_XP_BTQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6352.07, "timestamp": "01:45:52", "text": "是的，作为一名 YouTuber，我也想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6354.55, "timestam